class_name Trinkets
extends RefCounted
## The 100 unique trinkets of the main game (Legion Draft has its own).
##
## Trinkets are found on trinket hunts (Expeditions -> Trinkets), one of three
## offered per hunt. You own each trinket at most once, and each unit can hold
## two of them. A trinket's "mods" use the same battle modifiers as Legion
## Draft (see Army.unit_stats), plus "count_mult" for squad size.
## Data generated by tools; icons from the CC0 Dungeon Crawl tile set
## (assets/sprites/items/SOURCES.txt).

const SLOTS := 2
const RARITY_ORDER := ["common", "uncommon", "rare", "epic", "legendary"]
## Gold paid instead when a hunt turns up a trinket you already own.
